window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>After faking my own death, I’m back.</b></p> <p><b>And now I’ve blown it.</b></p> <p><b>Big time.</b></p> <p>I wasn’t supposed to touch her.</p> <p>I was ordered to watch over her, be her \"bodyguard\".</p> <p>She’s the MC boss’s little sister.</p> <p>And I’m just a guy who does her brother’s dirty work.</p> <p>We’ve known each other for years.</p> <p>But nothing could have prepared me for that night.</p> <p>Her sass, her curves — she brought me to my knees.</p> <p>When Vorn finds out I touched his sister, I’m dead.</p> <p>I’m not the guy she wants.</p> <p>I’m the asshole with a dangerous past.</p> <p>But I can’t bring myself to walk away.</p> <p>Suddenly, things spiral out of control.</p> <p>The woman I was sworn to protect is gone.</p> <p>I failed to keep her safe. </p> <p>But I will get her back.</p> <p>And I will stop at nothing until she’s safe in my arms. </p> <p>Even if that means burning down the city.</p> <p>From <i>USA Today</i> best-selling author, Jolie Day, comes a top-of-the-line story with a breathtaking twist. This is a full-length novel that can be listened to as a standalone. Most certainly for adult listeners only.</p>"; 
